stave 1

/// A glued edge joint (a rub joint): two boards planed straight and square
/// along their edges and glued edge to edge. It is how a wide panel is made
/// from narrow boards, and the way a part's boards are joined unless its
/// `boards:` says otherwise.
kind glued_edge : joint {
  require side_by_side   : edge_to_edge(piece, into) "an edge joint glues two boards lying side by side, edge to edge; these meet another way"
  require same_thickness : piece.thickness == into.thickness "boards glued edge to edge need the same thickness"

  insert: [push(piece, along: width)]

  note: "Plane each pair of edges straight and square together, then clamp the boards with cauls across the faces to keep them flat"
}
